{"id":"d7e0e0d8280a0db2","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Cantor Space Code","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code — ZFC Descriptive2 Cantor Space Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code — ZFC Descriptive2 Cantor Space Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cantor-space]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code — ZFC Descriptive2 Cantor Space Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e3b467d5761af40\" href=\"?note=4e3b467d5761af40\" title=\"58-df-cantor-space\">58-df-cantor-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\tau_C,d_C\\in V\">\\(C,\\tau_C,d_C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (Cantor-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e3b467d5761af40\" href=\"?note=4e3b467d5761af40\" title=\"58-df-cantor-space\">58-df-cantor-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (structure-explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCarrier}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCarrier}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (carrier-only existential reduct defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space\\text{-}code\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCode}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space\\text{-}code\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCode}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space\\text{-}code\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCarrier}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_C,d_C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space\\text{-}code\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCarrier}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_C,d_C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The code reuses the canonical Cantor-space structure, including its cylinder base and product topology.</li>\n<li>The carrier-only reduct has a distinct symbol; one predicate is no longer assigned both one-place and three-place signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"4e3b467d5761af40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"4e3b467d5761af40","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (Cantor-space predicate, see [[58-df-cantor-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,\\tau_C,d_C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCarrier}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space\\text{-}code\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCode}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space\\text{-}code\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CantorSpaceCarrier}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_C,d_C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C,d_C)","display":true}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1810","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive2-cantor-space-code]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4e3b467d5761af40","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}